      "heading": "2. Cramer's Rule & Linear Systems",
      "proseLatex": "For $n$ unknowns, $x_i = \\Delta_i / \\Delta$ where $\\Delta_i$ is the determinant with column $i$ replaced by constants.",
      "keyFormulas": [
        {
          "formulaId": "M02-F02",
          "label": "Cramer's Rule",
          "latex": "$x = \\Delta_x/\\Delta,\\; y = \\Delta_y/\\Delta,\\; z = \\Delta_z/\\Delta$",
          "aiExplainContext": "Solve 3-variable systems via determinants."
        }
      ]
